*.pyc
__pycache__/
relay.json
relay.log
agent.json
agent.log

# extensions/positron-bridge: node_modules is npm's to rebuild from
# package-lock.json (committed), and out/ is tsc's compiled output - both
# derived, neither is the source. The built positron-bridge.vsix itself IS
# committed (T13's own point: members install it without touching npm), so
# it is deliberately not listed here.
extensions/*/node_modules/
extensions/*/out/


# Spec Kit's downloaded extension catalog: a network cache, rebuilt on demand.
.specify/extensions/.cache/

# A deployment's credentials and settings (docs/SETTINGS.md). They live outside this
# repository; if a checkout ever holds one, it must not be added.
.seqera_token
env.yaml

# 008 platform: run indexes and token files are created at run time, never committed.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
# the platform test venv normally lives in ~/.cache; this covers a checkout-local one
abf-platform-venv/

# 009g: the build copies skills/ here for the wheel; skills/ stays the only source.
platform/abf_platform/skills/

# TypeSafe key for the optional Jev triage (docs/SETTINGS.md)
.typesafe_key
